{"backgroundInformation":"This model represents the dynamic relationship between pollution and natural resources in a socio-environmental system. Pollution is generated as a function of population, economic activity (capital), and a standard level of pollution per capita. At the same time, pollution is reduced through natural absorption processes, which depend on the environment’s capacity and the time required to absorb pollutants. Natural resources, on the other hand, are depleted through utilization driven by population and the desired material standard of living. As resources are consumed, the fraction of remaining natural resources declines, influencing future extraction rates and overall system sustainability. The model highlights the feedback loops between economic activity, resource consumption, and environmental impact. Increased production and consumption raise pollution and accelerate resource depletion, while limited natural absorption and finite resources constrain long-term growth, illustrating the trade-offs between development and environmental sustainability.","@type":"XMILEModel","modelId":"Pollution","sourceFile":"Pollution.xmile","simSpecs":{"method":"RK4","time_units":"Year","start":"1900","stop":"2100","dt":"0.25"},"variables":[{"type":"stock","name":"Capital","units":"Capital_units","eqn":"capital_initial","inflows":["capital investment"],"outflows":["capital depreciation"]},{"type":"stock","name":"Capital_Agriculture_Fraction","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"capital_agriculture_fraction_initial","inflows":["capital agriculture fraction adjustment time"],"outflows":[]},{"type":"stock","name":"Natural_Resources","units":"Resource_units","eqn":"natural_resources_initial","inflows":[],"outflows":["natural resource utilization"]},{"type":"stock","name":"Pollution","units":"Pollution_units","eqn":"pollution_initial","inflows":["pollution generation"],"outflows":["pollution absorption"]},{"type":"stock","name":"Population","units":"People","eqn":"population_initial","inflows":["births"],"outflows":["deaths"]},{"type":"aux","name":"births","units":"People/Year","eqn":"Population * birth_rate_normal * births_material_multiplier * births_crowding_multiplier * births_food_multiplier * births_pollution_multiplier"},{"type":"aux","name":"births_crowding_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"births_crowding_mult_tab ( crowding )"},{"type":"aux","name":"births_food_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"births_food_mult_tab ( food_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"births_material_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"births_material_mult_tab ( material_standard_of_living )"},{"type":"aux","name":"births_pollution_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"births_pollution_mult_tab ( pollution_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_agriculture_fraction_indicated","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"capital_agriculture_fraction_indicated_tab ( food_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_depreciation","units":"Capital_units/Year","eqn":"Capital * capital_depreciation_normal"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_investment","units":"Capital_units/Year","eqn":"Population * capital_investment_multiplier * capital_investment_rate_normal"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_investment_from_quality_ratio","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"capital_investment_quality_ratio_tab ( quality_material_multiplier / quality_food_multiplier )"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_investment_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"capital_investment_mult_tab ( material_standard_of_living )"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_investment_rate_normal","units":"Capital_units/(Person*Year)","eqn":"GAME ( capital_investment_rate_normal_c)"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_ratio","units":"Capital_units/Person","eqn":"Capital / Population"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_ratio_agriculture","units":"Capital_units/Person","eqn":"capital_ratio * Capital_Agriculture_Fraction / capital_agriculture_fraction_normal"},{"type":"aux","name":"crowding","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"Population / ( land_area * population_density_normal )"},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths","units":"People/Year","eqn":"Population * death_rate_normal * deaths_material_multiplier * deaths_pollution_multiplier * deaths_food_multiplier * deaths_crowding_multiplier"},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths_crowding_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"deaths_crowding_mult_tab ( crowding )"},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths_food_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"deaths_food_mult_tab ( food_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths_material_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"deaths_material_mult_tab ( material_standard_of_living )"},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths_pollution_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"deaths_pollution_mult_tab ( pollution_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"effective_capital_ratio","units":"Capital_units/Person","eqn":"capital_ratio * natural_resource_extraction_multiplier * ( 1 - Capital_Agriculture_Fraction ) / ( 1 - capital_agriculture_fraction_normal )"},{"type":"aux","name":"food_crowding_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"food_crowding_mult_tab ( crowding )"},{"type":"aux","name":"food_per_capita_potential","units":"Food_units/(Person*Year)","eqn":"food_per_capita_potential_tab ( capital_ratio_agriculture )"},{"type":"aux","name":"food_pollution_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"food_pollution_mult_tab ( pollution_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"food_ratio","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"food_per_capita_potential * food_crowding_multiplier * food_pollution_multiplier * food_coefficient / food_per_capita_normal"},{"type":"aux","name":"material_standard_of_living","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"effective_capital_ratio / effective_capital_ratio_normal"},{"type":"aux","name":"nat_res_matl_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"natural_resource_material_mult_tab ( material_standard_of_living )"},{"type":"aux","name":"natural_resource_extraction_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"natural_resource_extraction_mult_tab ( natural_resource_fraction_remaining )"},{"type":"aux","name":"natural_resource_fraction_remaining","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"Natural_Resources / natural_resources_initial"},{"type":"aux","name":"natural_resource_utilization","units":"Resource_units/Year","eqn":"Population * natural_resource_utilization_normal * nat_res_matl_multiplier"},{"type":"aux","name":"natural_resource_utilization_normal","units":"Resource_units/(Person*Year)","eqn":"GAME ( natural_resource_utilization_normal_c)"},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_absorption","units":"Pollution_units/Year","eqn":"Pollution / pollution_absorption_time"},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_absorption_time","units":"Year","eqn":"pollution_absorption_time_tab ( pollution_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_capital_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"pollution_capital_mult_tab ( capital_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_generation","units":"Pollution_units/Year","eqn":"Population * pollution_per_capita_normal * pollution_capital_multiplier"},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_ratio","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"Pollution / pollution_standard"},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_crowding_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"quality_crowding_mult_tab ( crowding )"},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_food_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"quality_food_mult_tab ( food_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_material_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"quality_material_mult_tab ( material_standard_of_living )"},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_of_life","units":"Satisfaction_units","eqn":"quality_of_life_normal * quality_material_multiplier * quality_crowding_multiplier * quality_food_multiplier * quality_pollution_multiplier"},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_pollution_multiplier","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"quality_pollution_mult_tab ( pollution_ratio )"},{"type":"aux","name":"births_crowding_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"births_food_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"births_material_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"births_pollution_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_agriculture_fraction_indicated_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_investment_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_investment_quality_ratio_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths_crowding_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths_food_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths_material_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"deaths_pollution_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"food_crowding_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"food_per_capita_potential_tab","units":"Food_units/(Person*Year)","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"food_pollution_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"natural_resource_extraction_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"natural_resource_material_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_absorption_time_tab","units":"Year","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_capital_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_crowding_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_food_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_material_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_pollution_mult_tab","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"birth_rate_normal","units":"1/Year","eqn":"0.04"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_agriculture_fraction_adjustment_time","units":"Year","eqn":"15"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_agriculture_fraction_initial","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"0.2"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_agriculture_fraction_normal","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"0.3"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_depreciation_normal","units":"1/Year","eqn":"0.025"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_initial","units":"Capital_units","eqn":"4e+08"},{"type":"aux","name":"capital_investment_rate_normal_c","units":"Capital_units/(Person*Year)","eqn":"0.05"},{"type":"aux","name":"death_rate_normal","units":"1/Year","eqn":"0.028"},{"type":"aux","name":"effective_capital_ratio_normal","units":"Capital_units/Person","eqn":"1"},{"type":"aux","name":"food_coefficient","units":"Dimensionless","eqn":"1"},{"type":"aux","name":"food_per_capita_normal","units":"Food_units/(Person*Year)","eqn":"1"},{"type":"aux","name":"land_area","units":"Kilometer*Kilometer","eqn":"1.35e+08"},{"type":"aux","name":"natural_resource_utilization_normal_c","units":"Resource_units/(Person*Year)","eqn":"1"},{"type":"aux","name":"natural_resources_initial","units":"Resource_units","eqn":"9e+11"},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_initial","units":"Pollution_units","eqn":"2e+08"},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_per_capita_normal","units":"Pollution_units/(Person*Year)","eqn":"1"},{"type":"aux","name":"pollution_standard","units":"Pollution_units","eqn":"3.6e+09"},{"type":"aux","name":"population_density_normal","units":"Person/(Kilometer*Kilometer)","eqn":"26.5"},{"type":"aux","name":"population_initial","units":"People","eqn":"1.65e+09"},{"type":"aux","name":"quality_of_life_normal","units":"Satisfaction_units","eqn":"1"}]}